            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 9:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Huramu umwami w’i Tiro arungikira Salomo icete co kumwishura, at’ Uhoraho, kubg’ urukundo yakunze abantu biwe, ni co catumye akugira umwami wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.121.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 121:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huramu agerekako, aravuga, at’ Uhoraho, Imana y’ Abisirayeli, yaremye ijuru n’isi, ahimbazwe, kuko yahaye umwami Dawidi umwana akerebutse, yahawe ubuhanga n’ubgenge, akaba ari we agiye kuzokwubakira Uhoraho ingoro, no kuzokwiyubakira ingoro yiwe ubgiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati None ndungitse umuntu w’umuhinga yahawe ubgenge, yitwa Huramu‐abi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyina avuka mu ba Dani, ariko se yar’ uw’ i Tiro. N’umuhanga azi gucura ivy’ amazahabu n’ivy’ amafeza n’ivy’ imiringa n’ ivy’ ivyuma, azi no kubāza amabuye n’ibiti, no kujisha impuzu z’amashigisha n’iz’ amasufe n’ izera derere n’izisa n’agahama, azi no guca amagarwe y’uburyo bgose, azi no kwigenera ivy’ ubuhinga bg’uburyo bgose. Azofatanya n’abantu bawe b’abahinga, ari bo bahinga nyakwubahwa so Dawidi yasize atoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero za ngano na sayiri n’amavuta ya elayo na vino, ivyo wavuze, nyakwubahwa, uz’ ubiturungikire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "natwe tuzohumbira ibiti i Lebanoni, ivy’ uzogomba vyose; tuzobikurungikira tubitēkeye imbambo, tubicishe mu kiyaga bishike i Yopa; nawe uz’ ubidūganishe i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
